<title>POLAND: Kety Q1 net flat at PLN 8.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Kety Q1 net flat at PLN 8.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kety SA preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    12.00   vs   12.33</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			11.52   vs   13.92</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.26   vs    8.14</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Metali Lekkich Kety</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    101.60   vs   91.34</p>
<p>    costs of sales			89.47   vs   79.13</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.13   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.27   vs    5.79</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.79   vs    2.75</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.14   vs    1.15</p>
<p>    investment			     2.40   vs    0.35</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
